What this licence does not cover

The MIT licence above covers this project's own work. It does not cover
these two files:

    packages/ds2-mss54/src/liveValueBlocks.generated.ts
    packages/ds2-mss54/src/adaptationBlocks.generated.ts

The byte offsets, data formats and scaling in them are derived from
MSS54 DS2 Tool, (c) 2026 karter16
(https://github.com/karter16/MSS54-DS2-Tool-Public), and are used here
with the author's permission. That permission was given to this project
and is not ours to pass on: to reuse those tables, ask karter16.
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md section 3.2 has the details.
